OL,3,GNEWSAArson probe after blaze at former
OL,4,Asocial club
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fire that caused extensive damage to
OL,7,Fa former social club in Nottingham is
OL,8,Fbeing treated by police as a potential
OL,9,Farson.
OL,11,FMultiple crews from Stockhill, Arnold,
OL,12,FLondon Road, Carlton and Hucknall
OL,13,Ffought the blaze at the disused Top
OL,14,FValley Social Club in Ridgeway Walk
OL,15,Ffollowing a call at 19:29 BST on
OL,16,FWednesday.
OL,18,FNottinghamshire Police said the fire in
OL,19,Fthe roof of the single-storey building
OL,20,Fcaused the roof to collapse and further
OL,21,Fstructural damage.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
